  "body": "Crafted for those who appreciate refined simplicity and modern elegance, this brand new single level home delivers a premium lifestyle in a peaceful, private setting. With its thoughtful design, effortless flow, and low maintenance appeal, it's an exceptional choice for first home buyers, downsizers, or investors seeking a touch of luxury without compromise.\r\n\r\nWhat Makes This Home Exceptional:\r\n\r\n* Three Bedrooms, Two Beautifully Appointed Bathrooms\r\n- A serene master suite featuring a walk-in wardrobe and a refined private ensuite  \r\n- Two additional bedrooms complemented by a sleek, contemporary family bathroom  \r\n- A layout that balances privacy, comfort, and understated luxury  \r\n\r\n* Designer Kitchen With Premium Finishes\r\n- A modern, well appointed kitchen with quality appliances and a central island  \r\n- Generous storage and elegant detailing elevate everyday living  \r\n- Seamless connection to open plan dining and living - perfect for stylish entertaining  \r\n\r\n* Effortless Indoor-Outdoor Living\r\n- Sun soaked living area opening to a private deck overlooking the tranquil reserve  \r\n- Master bedroom also flows outdoors, creating a peaceful morning retreat  \r\n- A natural backdrop that enhances the sense of calm and exclusivity  \r\n\r\n* Year Round Climate Comfort\r\n- Central air conditioning ensures consistent luxury living in every season  \r\n\r\n* Low Maintenance, Lock Up and Leave with Ease\r\n- Fully fenced, easy care grounds designed for minimal upkeep  \r\n- Ideal for busy professionals, downsizers, or those seeking a carefree lifestyle  \r\n\r\nA Location That Enhances Your Lifestyle:\r\n- Quick access to the motorway for effortless commuting  \r\n- Close to parks, scenic walkways, and quality schools  \r\n- A new shopping centre planned for the area - adding even more convenience and value  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nCall Shaun - 021 871 252 or Lyn on 021809273 to experience this brand new affordable - luxury home for yourself.\r\n\r\n**Please note:** Some photos are from the home two doors down with the same layout but a different style.",
